data: {"id": "82fcd936b6694f51-thinking-parallel_evidence-3580", "run_id": "82fcd936b6694f51", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**生命周期与指标**\n- Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 当前 **Pending**（kube-state-metrics 显示 phase=Pending=1，Running/Succeeded/Failed/Unknown 均为 0）。\n- 容器 `app` 处于 **Waiting / ContainerCreating** 状态（`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `ContainerCreating`，且持续为 1）。\n- 重启计数为 **0**，表明容器尚未成功启动过。\n- Pod UID：`f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`，调度在节点 **node2 (10.2.0.50)**。\n\n**事件（Events）——关键证据**\n两个重复出现的 Warning 事件，时间跨度约 **16~19 分钟**：\n1. `FailedMount` (x8 over 16m): `Unable to attach or mount volu", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789127852005, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

